{"version":1,"content":"<p>ViuTV綜藝節目《MIRROR ACE》今晚（30日）播出最後一集。</p><p>節目組特別安排MIRROR成員圍坐享用火鍋及進行小遊戲，全體成員禁止以英文名稱呼隊友，必須直呼對方中文全名，違者須罰酒一杯。</p><p>姜濤多次不慎誤呼隊友英文名而頻頻被罰，喝至面紅耳赤，更坦言自己已開始感到醉意。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:52.102800+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:33:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.892705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.441550+00:00","content_hash":"009e49f554acdf15ef4c66a2cd61cd017ce6152c554844e0356a0ccfc0e43064","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}